    "Core Moves program aborted.\n"
    "Returning back to main menu."
}
text TeachZygardeWhichMove{
    "Teach Zygarde which move?"
}
text OnlyOneZygarde{
    "Only one Zygarde can be\n"
    "assembled at a time.\p"
    "Returning back to main menu."
}
text AssembleWhichZygarde{
    "Assemble which Zygarde?"
}
text AttemptingToAssemble10Forme{
    "Attempting to assemble 10% Forme\n"
    "{PLAY_SE SE_ELEVATOR}Zygarde…{PAUSE 0x0F}{PAUSE 0x0F}{PAUSE 0x0F}{PAUSE 0x0F}…{PAUSE 0x0F}{PAUSE 0x0F}{PAUSE 0x0F}{PAUSE 0x0F}…{PAUSE 0x0F}{PAUSE 0x0F}{PAUSE 0x0F}{PAUSE 0x0F}{PLAY_SE SE_DING_DONG} Assembly completed.{PAUSE 0x0F}{PAUSE 0x0F}{PAUSE 0x0F}{PAUSE 0x0F}"
}
text AttemptingToAssemble50Forme{
    "Attempting to assemble 50% Forme\n"
    "{PLAY_SE SE_ELEVATOR}Zygarde…{PAUSE 0x0F}{PAUSE 0x0F}{PAUSE 0x0F}{PAUSE 0x0F}…{PAUSE 0x0F}{PAUSE 0x0F}{PAUSE 0x0F}{PAUSE 0x0F}…{PAUSE 0x0F}{PAUSE 0x0F}{PAUSE 0x0F}{PAUSE 0x0F}{PLAY_SE SE_DING_DONG} Assembly completed.{PAUSE 0x0F}{PAUSE 0x0F}{PAUSE 0x0F}{PAUSE 0x0F}"
}
text NoZygardeCurrentlyAssembled{
    "No Zygarde is currently\n"
    "assembled.\p"
    "Returning back to main menu."
}
text NoZygardeDetectedInParty{
    "No Zygarde found for\n"
    "interaction.\p"
    "Returning back to main menu."
}
text ZygardeOnlyMonInParty{
    "Zygarde is currently your only Pokémon\n"
    "and as such can't be separated."
}
text ChooseZygardeForSeparation{
    "Please choose a Zygarde for\n"
    "the separation process."
}
text SeparationAborted{
    "Separation process aborted.\n"
    "Returning back to main menu."
}
text ZygardeOnlyAliveMon{
    "Cannot separate Zygarde when it is\n"
    "the only non-fainted Pokemon."
}
text ZygardeRevertedBackToCellsAndCores{
    "Attempting to separate Zygarde back\n"
    "to Cells and Cores…{PLAY_SE SE_ELEVATOR}{PAUSE 0x0F}{PAUSE 0x0F}{PAUSE 0x0F}{PAUSE 0x0F}…{PAUSE 0x0F}{PAUSE 0x0F}{PAUSE 0x0F}{PAUSE 0x0F}…{PAUSE 0x0F}{PAUSE 0x0F}{PAUSE 0x0F}{PAUSE 0x0F}{PLAY_SE SE_DING_DONG}{PAUSE 0x0F}{PAUSE 0x0F}"
}
text SeparatedSuccessfully{
    "Zygarde separated successfully.\n"
    "Returning back to main menu."
}
text NoZygardeDetectedInParty_Assembly{
    "A Zygarde has alredy been assembled,\n"
    "but could not be found in the party.\p"
    "Returning back to main menu."
}
text ChooseZygardeForAssembly{
    "Only one Zygarde can be\n"
    "assembled at a time.\p"
    "Please choose an existing Zygarde\n"
    "for the assembly process."
}
text AssemblyAborted{
    "Assembly process aborted.\n"
    "Returning back to main menu."
}
text SpeciesNotZygarde{
    "Chosen Pokémon is not a Zygarde.\n"
    "Returning back to main menu."
}
text NotEnoughCellsAndCoresInCube{
    "Assembling a 50% Forme Zygarde\n"
    "requires at least 50 Cells and\l"
    "3 Cores.\p"
    "A total of {STR_VAR_1} Cells and\n"
    "{STR_VAR_2} Cores have been collected."
}
text SelectZygardeToTeachMove{
    "Please choose a Zygarde for\n"
    "the Core Moves program."
}


